    "['undo [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'delete disable', 'parent_command': ['interfaces ge-2/0/0'], 'root': 'interfaces ge-2/0/0', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\ndelete disable\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- In Huawei, `undo shutdown` enables an interface that was previously shutdown.\\n- The Juniper equivalent is `delete disable`, which removes the `disable` flag from an interface, effectively enabling it.\\n- Both commands serve the same purpose of activating an interface that was administratively down.', 'trans_template': 'delete disable'}]]": 1,
