    "['tunnel-protocol [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols gre tunnel tunnel1 encapsulation gre', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nset protocols gre tunnel tunnel1 encapsulation gre\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper, GRE tunnels are configured under `protocols gre tunnel` with encapsulation explicitly set to `gre`. The tunnel interface name (tunnel1 in this case) needs to be specified in the command. This differs from Huawei's interface-level `tunnel-protocol gre` command.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols gre tunnel tunnel1 encapsulation gre'}]]": 1,
