    "['destination [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces gr-1/1 tunnel destination 172.21.1.2', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the Juniper equivalent of the Huawei GRE tunnel destination configuration:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces gr-1/1 tunnel destination 172.21.1.2\\n##\\n\\nNotes:\\n1. In Juniper, GRE interfaces are typically named as gr-fpc/pic/port (gr-1/1 in this example, assuming slot 1/1)\\n2. The command sets the remote endpoint for the GRE tunnel, which is the exact equivalent of Huawei\\'s \"destination\" parameter in the tunnel interface configuration', 'trans_template': 'set interfaces gr-1/1 tunnel destination 172.21.1.2'}]]": 1,
